; Grey-olive wool — folded blankets, spare institutional clothing, slipper
; uppers. The kit's fabric family already has props/ticking (mattress
; bedding, warm and stained) and props/vinyl (moulded seat shells); this is
; the third leg, a heavier draped textile that reads as issued rather than
; personal. Pulled toward the palette board's "dark olive"/"grey-green"
; rather than a true neutral grey, so it sits in the same family as
; materials/enamel_green.tres without matching it outright.
;
; Fully rough (0.88) — wool takes no specular highlight worth modelling, and
; a shinier value here would read as synthetic/plastic next to props/ticking
; right next to it on the same bed. Luminance ~0.32, comfortably clear of the
; ~0.20 floor other agents found ACES + the harness's contrast pass crushing
; to black — this is a mid-value fabric, never the darkest thing in a room.

